      "name": "Record Form",
      "description": {
        "content": "A Record's **Form** is based on its **Record Type**.\n\nA Form is comprised of **Fields** which are contained within **Sections**. Each Field is of a specific data Type, and has a **Label** and a **Value**.\n",
        "type": "text/plain"
      },
